    "question": "A regional US health system is upgrading its infant abduction prevention framework in a newborn intensive care unit (NICU) to comply with The Joint Commission (TJC) standards. How should the security manager integrate active RFID skin-sentiment tags with the facility’s physical access control and building automation systems to prevent a breach?",
