    "question": "An asset protection team at a major US port facility receives an automated alert indicating that a shipping container holding high-value electronics has experienced a light-sensor and GPS-geofence breach while staged in the holding yard. Outline the immediate tactical dispatch and containment protocol required to intercept the theft while preserving federal evidentiary standards.",
